  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "1.town",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.267,
      "text": "In this town, my family stole things."
    },
    {
      "id": "1.dad",
      "start": 2.267,
      "end": 3.6,
      "text": "My dad took a sword once,"
    },
    {
      "id": "1.sis",
      "start": 3.6,
      "end": 5.167,
      "text": "my sister took a whole cooked chicken,"
    },
    {
      "id": "1.me",
      "start": 5.167,
      "end": 6.967,
      "text": "and I was the worst thief we ever had."
    },
    {
      "id": "2.sister",
      "start": 6.967,
      "end": 9.383,
      "text": "My sister could steal the pin out of a hat and hang it back up,"
    },
    {
      "id": "2.roof",
      "start": 9.383,
      "end": 11.41,
      "text": "and I fell off a roof twice in one night."
    },
    {
      "id": "3.den",
      "start": 11.41,
      "end": 14.343,
      "text": "Our den was full of things, a bell rope, a hat,"
    },
    {
      "id": "3.rope",
      "start": 14.343,
      "end": 16.713,
      "text": "eleven left boots, all eleven of them left,"
    },
    {
      "id": "3.boots",
      "start": 16.713,
      "end": 18.48,
      "text": "and nobody ever explained the boots."
    },
    {
      "id": "3.carry",
      "start": 18.48,
      "end": 20.64,
      "text": "We carry one thing in our mouth, that's the rule,"
    },
    {
      "id": "3.drop",
      "start": 20.64,
      "end": 22.623,
      "text": "and if we find food we drop it to eat."
    },
    {
      "id": "3.good",
      "start": 22.623,
      "end": 23.68,
      "text": "It was a good life."
    },
    {
      "id": "3.but",
      "start": 23.68,
      "end": 25.48,
      "text": "But I had never taken one thing that mattered."
    },
    {
      "id": "4.night",
      "start": 25.48,
      "end": 27.78,
      "text": "On my first night alone my dad gave me the rules."
    },
    {
      "id": "4.one",
      "start": 27.78,
      "end": 29.827,
      "text": "\"One thing, and nothing anybody is holding.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "4.window",
      "start": 29.827,
      "end": 31.79,
      "text": "Then I saw the window with a cup on the sill,"
    },
    {
      "id": "4.width",
      "start": 31.79,
      "end": 33.29,
      "text": "open a hand's width every night,"
    },
    {
      "id": "4.cup",
      "start": 33.29,
      "end": 35.15,
      "text": "and in the cup, one red flower."
    },
    {
      "id": "5.climb",
      "start": 35.15,
      "end": 36.387,
      "text": "I didn't even have to climb."
    },
    {
      "id": "5.easy",
      "start": 36.387,
      "end": 39.89,
      "text": "It was the easiest thing I ever took. Not a sword. A flower,"
    },
    {
      "id": "5.thought",
      "start": 39.89,
      "end": 41.82,
      "text": "and I thought, this is a thing that matters."
    },
    {
      "id": "5.home",
      "start": 41.82,
      "end": 43.363,
      "text": "I carried it home in my mouth."
    },
    {
      "id": "6.hedge",
      "start": 43.363,
      "end": 45.197,
      "text": "In the morning I watched the house from the hedge,"
    },
    {
      "id": "6.boy",
      "start": 45.197,
      "end": 46.463,
      "text": "and the boy came out to the cup,"
    },
    {
      "id": "6.cried",
      "start": 46.463,
      "end": 48.563,
      "text": "he looked in it, then he sat on the step and cried."
    },
    {
      "id": "6.golem",
      "start": 48.563,
      "end": 50.563,
      "text": "The iron golem came up the path and stopped,"
    },
    {
      "id": "6.gave",
      "start": 50.563,
      "end": 52.793,
      "text": "It gave him that flower. I worked that out later."
    },
    {
      "id": "7.sister",
      "start": 52.793,
      "end": 55.693,
      "text": "My sister found me in the hedge with a whole chicken in her mouth."
    },
    {
      "id": "7.said",
      "start": 55.693,
      "end": 59.9,
      "text": "\"You took a thing that was a present,\" she said. \"That's not stealing. That's hurting,\""
    },
    {
      "id": "7.day",
      "start": 59.9,
      "end": 62.327,
      "text": "take it back in the day, that's the only way it counts.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "8.walk",
      "start": 62.327,
      "end": 65.193,
      "text": "So I went back in the day, a fox in a village at noon,"
    },
    {
      "id": "8.dogs",
      "start": 65.193,
      "end": 67.427,
      "text": "and every dog in that town knew before I did."
    },
    {
      "id": "8.turn",
      "start": 67.427,
      "end": 70.06,
      "text": "I got halfway up the path and the golem turned round,"
    },
    {
      "id": "8.ran",
      "start": 70.06,
      "end": 72.193,
      "text": "so I ran with the flower still in my mouth."
    },
    {
      "id": "9.night",
      "start": 72.193,
      "end": 75.443,
      "text": "That night there were berries on the sill, a little pile, red,"
    },
    {
      "id": "9.drop",
      "start": 75.443,
      "end": 76.567,
      "text": "and I dropped the flower,"
    },
    {
      "id": "9.ate",
      "start": 76.567,
      "end": 79.067,
      "text": "because of course I ate them, that's what a fox does."
    },
    {
      "id": "9.nothing",
      "start": 79.067,
      "end": 80.5,
      "text": "Then I went home with nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "id": "10.next",
      "start": 80.5,
      "end": 83.58,
      "text": "Next night, berries again, and a boot, the left one."
    },
    {
      "id": "10.dropped",
      "start": 83.58,
      "end": 84.547,
      "text": "I dropped the boot."
    },
    {
      "id": "10.told",
      "start": 84.547,
      "end": 86.987,
      "text": "\"He's not scared of us,\" my sister said. \"He's waiting.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "11.corner",
      "start": 86.987,
      "end": 90.523,
      "text": "So I looked in our den, and in the corner, behind all of it, berries."
    },
    {
      "id": "11.count",
      "start": 90.523,
      "end": 92.923,
      "text": "One berry under every single thing we ever took,"
    },
    {
      "id": "11.boots2",
      "start": 92.923,
      "end": 96.19,
      "text": "eleven boots, ten berries, so the boots were never worth one."
    },
    {
      "id": "11.buying",
      "start": 96.19,
      "end": 98.26,
      "text": "He was buying his town back, one thing a night,"
    },
    {
      "id": "11.never",
      "start": 98.26,
      "end": 99.883,
      "text": "and we never once asked why."
    },
    {
      "id": "12.none",
      "start": 99.883,
      "end": 101.05,
      "text": "He wasn't feeding me."
    },
    {
      "id": "12.trade",
      "start": 101.05,
      "end": 101.9,
      "text": "He was trading."
    },
    {
      "id": "12.flower",
      "start": 101.9,
      "end": 103.923,
      "text": "And in the cup that morning, a new flower,"
    },
    {
      "id": "12.second",
      "start": 103.923,
      "end": 105.69,
      "text": "and a second cup beside it, empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "13.berry",
      "start": 105.69,
      "end": 106.99,
      "text": "So I put a berry in it."
    },
    {
      "id": "13.bad",
      "start": 106.99,
      "end": 108.24,
      "text": "I'm a terrible thief."
    },
    {
      "id": "13.sister",
      "start": 108.24,
      "end": 110.69,
      "text": "My sister says it's the first thing I ever took worth anything."
    },
    {
      "id": "13.only",
      "start": 110.69,
      "end": 113.33,
      "text": "In this town my family stole things. I traded."
    },
    {
      "id": "14.sub",
      "start": 113.33,
      "end": 115.847,
      "text": "Subscribe before I find out what the boots were for."
    }
  ],
